Removes the fix of finding-51-sync-fast-forward.trace: the shows-the-same guard
on a sync's fast-forward (introduced without it in 6049b1b, fixed in e9ab747).
Base: 7474470 (agentfs-core unchanged since). git: the release in ci/git-release.
Re-record (crates/agentfs-model/VERIFYING.md, "A regression found on the engine"),
in a scratch worktree with this applied, through ci/model-docker.sh:
  AGENTFS_MODEL_TRACE_DIR=/work/t cargo test -p agentfs-conformance --test replay \
    finding_51_a_sync_that_cannot_show_the_upstreams_commit_merges  # fails here
  cargo run -p agentfs-conformance --bin phase1-replay -- library /work/t \
    --min-scenarios 0 --min-seeds 0 --only finding_51_a_sync_that --record /work/out
  cp /work/out/finding_51_a_sync_that*.trace \
    crates/agentfs-conformance/tests/regressions/finding-51-sync-fast-forward.trace
`git apply` skips these lines.

